 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Usually, one family pays for the big stuff like venue, caterer and dress, and the other covers the little stuff like flowers, music and guests from outside. Then it' negotiation. What do you think is fair based on typical costs in your area? Not at all. It gives you a number to aim for instead of saying each family pays a figure out of thin air. Then it' who pays for what in your friendship group as a first cut. Then it which family can afford what on second thought. Good idea. Let me know what they say.",
